{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game through your input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the unknown and experience the infinite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you can input anything to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_155432.png?t=1743212324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a groundbreaking AI-driven text adventure game, it combines dynamic AI-generated storytelling with 3D visuals, delivering an unprecedented immersive experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_155805.png?t=1743212324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>The powerful AI allows you to choose any theme\u2014fantasy adventure/horror investigation/space exploration/martial arts/cats and dogs/SCP\u2014play however you want and enjoy to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_155432.png?t=1743212324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This new way of gaming is just beginning to sprout and will gradually evolve. It\u2019s completely different from traditional games. Stay tuned as we continue to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax, immerse yourself in text and role-playing, find joy, craft your own story, and become a storyteller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come and experience it! Wishing you a great time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567920?t=1743212324","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567920?t=1743212324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35679